<% content_for :title, "Pricing · InternalQ" %>

<div class="kv-page">
  <div class="kv-page-header">
    <div class="kv-heading-group">
      <h1>Simple, honest pricing</h1>
      <p class="kv-page-subtitle">Start free. Upgrade when your team needs more. No hidden fees, no per-seat charges.</p>
    </div>
    <span class="kv-pill">
      <span class="kv-pill-dot"></span>
      Beta pricing
    </span>
  </div>

  <div class="kv-pricing-grid">

    <%# ── Free plan ── %>
    <div class="kv-plan-card kv-table-card">
      <div class="kv-plan-header">
        <span class="kv-plan-name">Free</span>
        <div class="kv-plan-price">
          <span class="kv-plan-amount">$0</span>
          <span class="kv-plan-period">/ month</span>
        </div>
        <p class="kv-plan-desc">Everything you need to get started. No credit card, no commitment.</p>
      </div>

      <ul class="kv-plan-features">
        <li class="kv-plan-feature">30 questions per month</li>
        <li class="kv-plan-feature">Unlimited documents</li>
        <li class="kv-plan-feature">PDF &amp; Word file support (up to 10 MB)</li>
        <li class="kv-plan-feature">Slack bot — @mention or DM</li>
        <li class="kv-plan-feature">Web Q&amp;A interface</li>
        <li class="kv-plan-feature">Source citations on every answer</li>
        <li class="kv-plan-feature">Unanswered questions log</li>
        <li class="kv-plan-feature">Team member access</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="kv-plan-cta">
        <% if user_signed_in? %>
          <%= link_to "Go to dashboard", dashboard_path, class: "kv-secondary-button kv-plan-button" %>
        <% else %>
          <%= button_to user_google_oauth2_omniauth_authorize_path,
                        method: :post,
                        class: "kv-secondary-button kv-plan-button",
                        form: { data: { turbo: false } } do %>
            Get started free
          <% end %>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <%# ── Pro plan ── %>
    <div class="kv-plan-card kv-plan-card-pro kv-table-card">
      <div class="kv-plan-header">
        <div class="kv-plan-name-row">
          <span class="kv-plan-name">Pro</span>
          <span class="kv-tag kv-plan-badge">Best for growing teams</span>
        </div>
        <div class="kv-plan-price">
          <span class="kv-plan-amount">$29</span>
          <span class="kv-plan-period">/ month</span>
        </div>
        <p class="kv-plan-desc">Unlimited questions for teams that use InternalQ every day.</p>
      </div>

      <ul class="kv-plan-features">
        <li class="kv-plan-feature kv-plan-feature-highlight">Unlimited questions</li>
        <li class="kv-plan-feature">Unlimited documents</li>
        <li class="kv-plan-feature">PDF &amp; Word file support (up to 10 MB)</li>
        <li class="kv-plan-feature">Slack bot — @mention or DM</li>
        <li class="kv-plan-feature">Web Q&amp;A interface</li>
        <li class="kv-plan-feature">Source citations on every answer</li>
        <li class="kv-plan-feature">Unanswered questions log</li>
        <li class="kv-plan-feature">Team member access</li>
        <li class="kv-plan-feature">Priority email support</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="kv-plan-cta">
        <a href="mailto:support@internalq.zezlab.com?subject=InternalQ%20Pro%20upgrade"
           class="kv-primary-button kv-plan-button">
          Contact us to upgrade
        </a>
        <p class="kv-plan-cta-note">We reply within 24 hours and get you set up same day.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <%# ── FAQ ── %>
  <div class="kv-pricing-faq">
    <div class="kv-pricing-faq-item">
      <span class="kv-pricing-faq-q">What counts as a question?</span>
      <span class="kv-pricing-faq-a">Each question asked — in Slack or the web app — uses one question from your monthly allowance. Uploading or deleting documents does not count.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="kv-pricing-faq-item">
      <span class="kv-pricing-faq-q">What happens when I hit the limit?</span>
      <span class="kv-pricing-faq-a">The Slack bot will notify you. Your documents and all your data stay intact — you just can't ask new questions until the month resets or you upgrade.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="kv-pricing-faq-item">
      <span class="kv-pricing-faq-q">How does upgrading work?</span>
      <span class="kv-pricing-faq-a">Email <a href="mailto:support@internalq.zezlab.com">support@internalq.zezlab.com</a>. We'll send you a payment link and enable unlimited questions for your organization — usually same day.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="kv-pricing-faq-item">
      <span class="kv-pricing-faq-q">Is my data private?</span>
      <span class="kv-pricing-faq-a">Yes. Your documents are only used to answer your own team's questions. They are never shared with other organizations or used to train AI models.</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="kv-soft-divider"></div>
  <p class="kv-meta-text kv-meta-muted">
    Questions? <a href="mailto:support@internalq.zezlab.com">support@internalq.zezlab.com</a> ·
    <%= link_to "Privacy policy", privacy_path %> ·
    <%= link_to "Support", support_path %>
  </p>
</div>
